      <p>Same lead-toxicity concerns as any lead-acid chemistry. Gelled electrolyte reduces acid-spill risk during handling and transport but doesn't affect lead-content hazards during processing.</p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>Recycling and disposal</h2>
      <p>Standard lead-acid recycling processes handle gel batteries. The silica gel is processed separately from the lead components; downstream lead recovery is unchanged.</p>
